6	// Coalescing window for streams. Model deltas arrive in dense bursts (one
7	// `thinking_delta` per token); buffering them for this many milliseconds and
8	// merging consecutive same-item deltas turns N tiny SSE frames/Redis messages
9	// into roughly one per tick without adding perceptible latency.
10	const STREAM_TICK_MS = 12
